      about: "A healthy total can hide a job nobody wants. The photo eye bracket has waited 50 days, past its due date by more than a month; at priority 4 it keeps losing to everything else, while Conveyor 3 had 13 jams this week, and a loose eye bracket is one cause of a missed or false jam. The gas train calibration and the missed weekly PM are overdue too. The Burner B igniter order is the one the 05:52 handoff note said had been opened.",
